st, the three baseline runs — Mark runs them (order in the reply); part 2 records the baseline and decides on A/B. · Decided: stamping `session_id` on an approved chunk is provenance, not an edit — it is what `--sessions` would have written at ingest; logged, not silent. Template untouched until the baseline is read.
